flowchart LR
    S([Student])
    CL([Club leader])
    O([Organiser])
    A([Administrator])

    CH[ITC Club Hub]

    MAIL[[E-mail service]]
    DIR[[ITC student directory]]

    S -- browse clubs, register for events, cancel registration --> CH
    CH -- club information, event details, announcements --> S

    CL -- create clubs, update club information, manage members --> CH
    CH -- membership requests, member lists, club activity reports --> CL

    O -- create events, update schedules, record attendance --> CH
    CH -- event registrations, attendance lists, event reports --> O

    A -- manage accounts, assign roles, update system settings --> CH
    CH -- monthly reports, user activity reports --> A

    CH -- student ID lookup --> DIR
    DIR -- verified student name, student ID, e-mail --> CH

    CH -- confirmation e-mails, event reminders --> MAIL
    MAIL -- e-mail delivery status --> CH
